---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: '隱私權政策', url: '/privacy-policy/' }
];

const siteUrl = "https://www.petaginghub.com";
const hrefLangAlternates = [
  { lang: 'zh-TW', url: siteUrl + '/privacy-policy' },
  { lang: 'x-default', url: siteUrl + '/privacy-policy' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="隱私權政策 - Pet Aging Hub"
  description="了解我們如何收集、使用和保護您的個人資訊。"
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
 lang="zh-TW" hrefLangAlternates={hrefLangAlternates}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-4">
    <header class="text-center mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 text-sm font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mb-4">
        <span>🔒</span>
        <span>隱私安全保障</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">隱私權政策</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium text-lg">最後更新日期：2026年5月11日</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      
      <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-blue-500">01.</span> 我們收集的資訊
        </h2>
        <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          <p>Pet Aging Hub 重視您的隱私。請注意：</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>隱私優先：</strong>我們的計算機和工具不要求您建立帳戶或提供個人識別資訊。</li>
            <li><strong>本地運算：</strong>所有計算都在您的瀏覽器本地完成，我們不會儲存您輸入的年齡或體重資料。</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-blue-500">02.</span> Google Analytics
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          我們使用 Google Analytics 來分析網站流量，以優化使用者體驗。
        </p>
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 font-semibold border-b-2 border-blue-100 hover:border-blue-600 transition-all">
          安裝停用瀏覽器附加元件 →
        </a>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-blue-100 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-indigo-600">03.</span> AdSense 與廣告條款
        </h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">個人化廣告</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Google 會使用 Cookie 根據您過去的瀏覽記錄來投放與您興趣相關的廣告。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">您的選擇權</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">您可以造訪廣告設定頁面選擇退出個人化廣告。</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-xs bg-slate-900 text-white px-3 py-2 rounded-lg font-bold">Google 廣告設定</a>
              <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-xs bg-white text-slate-900 border border-slate-200 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg font-bold">AboutAds 退出</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-xl">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span>📧</span> 聯絡我們
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6">如果您對本隱私權政策有任何疑問，請隨時透過電子郵件與我們聯繫。</p>
        <div class="inline-block bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/20 px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl transition-colors">
          <span class="text-slate-400 block text-sm mb-1">官方聯絡信箱</span>
          <a href="mailto:monkamonme@gmail.com" class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400">透過電子郵件聯絡我們</a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
